  "period_note": "Year-end (31 December 2015) position from Islami Bank Bangladesh's own audited annual report 'Five Years Performance' table, taken from the FY2015 report (the reporting year's own document). SOLO / STANDALONE basis. Islami Bank Bangladesh is a Shariah-compliant bank, so its own terminology is used in original_metric_name: 'Investment' is the financing book (the equivalent of loans and advances), 'Investment Income' is the equivalent of interest income, and 'Profit Paid on deposit' is the equivalent of interest expense. The normalised metric names map these onto the dataset's conventional banking vocabulary: gross_loans holds General Investment, net_interest_income holds Net Investment Income, and classified_loans holds Classified Investment. Total liabilities are calculated as total assets (excluding contra) minus shareholders' equity; the source table does not print a total-liabilities line. total_assets is the balance-sheet total EXCLUDING contra items, which is the comparable figure for other banks in this dataset; the bank's own 'Total Assets (including Contra)' is retained separately as total_assets_incl_contra and is materially larger. RESTATEMENTS -- 14 figure(s) in this record are reported differently by other Islami Bank annual reports. Per this dataset's sourcing rule the contemporaneous value is kept and the divergence recorded here: reserve_fund: this record uses 27879.7 (AR2015); AR2016/AR2017/AR2019 report 27285.2; retained_earnings: this record uses 3219.98 (AR2015); AR2016/AR2017/AR2019 report 4076.16; total_equity: this record uses 47199.6 (AR2015); AR2016/AR2017/AR2019 report 47461.3; total_capital: this record uses 47845.3 (AR2015); AR2016 report 48701.6; npl_pct: this record uses 4.22 (AR2015); AR2016/AR2017 report 4.25; provision_classified: this record uses 9293.11 (AR2015); AR2019 report 11599.5; provision_required_classified: this record uses 9293.11 (AR2015); AR2019 report 11599.5; gross_expenditure: this record uses 47696.9 (AR2015); AR2017 report 47435.2; provision_charge: this record uses 13466.2 (AR2015); AR2016/AR2017/AR2019 report 5231.16, 5492.84; profit_before_tax: this record uses 8855.02 (AR2015); AR2016/AR2017/AR2019 report 9116.69; profit_after_tax: this record uses 3029.08 (AR2015); AR2017 report 3290.76; nav_per_share: this record uses 29.32 (AR2015); AR2016/AR2017 report 29.48; eps: this record uses 1.88 (AR2015); AR2019 report 2.04; roe_pct: this record uses 6.28 (AR2015); AR2016/AR2017/AR2019 report 7.",
